### PutAsync(Uri, HttpContent)
PUT {{HostAddress}}/putasync/repos/{{owner}}/{{repo}}/issues/update HTTP/2
Accept : application/json
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "issue_number": "1",
  "state": "open",
  "state_reason": "reopened",
  "labels": [
    "bug"
  ]  
}



